{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32666","headline":"送友人罢举赴蓟门从事 · 刘沧","name":"送友人罢举赴蓟门从事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人生行止在知己，远佐诸侯重所依。\n绿绶便当身是贵，青霄休怨志相违。\n晚云辽水疎残雨，寒角边城怨落晖。\n此去黄金台上客，相思应羡鴈南归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32666.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32666","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}